{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXTRA EXTRA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Newsie is done spreading the news\u2014he wants to<i> make</i>\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Page Turner</strong> is a classic run-and-gun platformer complete with secrets to discover, weapon pickups to collect, and boss fights to take down. Explore 1920's BigCity as a Newsie chasing leads in pursuit of becoming an investigative journalist. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>It's a Jungle Out There...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the work of Upton Sinclair, Level Two of <strong>Page Turner</strong> takes you through three Stages, each showcasing the hazardous working conditions of BigCity in the 1920s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea7 2-1 Hard Hats Required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf5 2-2 Business is Looming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd69 2-3 Tall Andrew's Meats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way through each stage and don't let anything stop you from getting the truth in print!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tell Us What You Think</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Page Turner</strong> is still in development with a full release expected in 2026. This demo offers a glimpse of what's to come and gives you the opportunity to help shape the final version of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for helping make <strong>Page Turner</strong> the best it can be\u2014I hope you enjoy Level Two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3600320?t=1744485318","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600320/60b91b151cad3c92b9bade5250255d2a0edfc11e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744485318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600320/97f12c24a69c15a9bc74e021c2bac6f9c20b96b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744485318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3600320/97f12c24a69c15a9bc74e021c2bac6f9c20b96b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744485318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXTRA EXTRA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Newsie is done spreading the news\u2014he wants to<i> make</i>\u00a0it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Page Turner</strong> is a classic run-and-gun platformer complete with secrets to discover, weapon pickups to collect, and boss fights to take down. Explore 1920's BigCity as a Newsie chasing leads in pursuit of becoming an investigative journalist. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>It's a Jungle Out There...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the work of Upton Sinclair, Level Two of <strong>Page Turner</strong> takes you through three Stages, each showcasing the hazardous working conditions of BigCity in the 1920s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea7 2-1 Hard Hats Required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf5 2-2 Business is Looming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd69 2-3 Tall Andrew's Meats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make your way through each stage and don't let anything stop you from getting the truth in print!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tell Us What You Think</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Page Turner</strong> is still in development with a full release expected in 2026. This demo offers a glimpse of what's to come and gives you the opportunity to help shape the final version of the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for helping make <strong>Page Turner</strong> the best it can be\u2014I hope you enjoy Level Two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["PoppKeys Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3600210","name":"Page Turner"}